Copyright 2026 ElMariones

This product is an independent implementation. Its feature set was inspired by:

- ComfyUI-QueueControl (https://github.com/seeker-ktf/ComfyUI-QueueControl), Apache License 2.0, by seeker-ktf:
  queue pause / resume, saved queue, persistent (auto-saved and auto-restored) queue.
- comfyui_queue_manager (https://github.com/QuietNoise/comfyui_queue_manager), GPL-3.0, by QuietNoise:
  archive (parked jobs), export / import, filtering by workflow, output gallery, open file location.

No source code from either project is included.
